Cycle 7: synthesis
  n=14 dead end: larger exact gated boxes still leaked; the long peel
  has no terminal endpoint core, so the route needs a structural descent.
  n=15 new idea: the same composite phenomenon appears with 15=3*5;
  it has a stronger CRT gate but likely needs a two-prime micro-staircase.
  disproof pressure: gate-overload and random searches made positive gaps,
  not open covers.  The best candidates are boundary-adjacent leaks,
  suggesting future attacks should rank peel depth and cell width together.
